    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's actually perfect, it has that intense, almost fanatical tone i was looking for. \n\ncan you take it a step further? i want the character to really lean into the idea that without him, the revolution would have just been a chaotic, meaningless mess of riots that accomplished nothing. make it sound like he was the only thing standing between the people and total, directionless anarchy.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
